      "body": {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "List aisa data structure hai jis mein kai data ke tukre ek khaas tarteeb (sequence) mein rakhe jate hain. Har tukre ko element kehte hain, aur har element list mein ek khaas index (number wali jagah) par hota hai. Is se element tak pohanchna aur use sambhalna aasan ho jata hai."
          },
          {
            "type": "checkpoint",
            "mode": "self_check",
            "prompt": "List ka element kya hai?",
            "explanation": "List mein rakha data ka ek tukra, jo ek khaas index par milta hai."
          },
          {
